notes of indulgent espresso. Perfect for a variety of <strong>recipes and cocktails, <\/strong>our Coffee Moonshine is great to enjoy neat over ice or can be used to elevate classic <strong>drinks<\/strong> like an  Espresso Martini or an Irish Coffee.<\/p><p>Bottled in traditional Mason Jars, we promise a unique drinking experience. If you would like to discover <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/collections\/moonshine\">more high quality liqueurs<\/a>, have a look at our entire product range. Become part of our <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/pages\/gang\" title=\"O'Donnell Gang\">Moonshine Gang<\/a> to collect proof points and unlock unique benefits.<\/p><p>For those new to Moonshine, it was the name given to illegally produced grain alcohol distilled during the American Prohibition. It was traditionally bottled in Mason Jars to avoid detection by the authorities. O’Donnell Moonshine retains the rebellious nature of that era, while delivering a whole new world of flavour in our range of smooth and delicious liqueurs.<\/p><h5>*Consult our <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/pages\/faq\">FAQ's<\/a> for more information.<\/h5><p><strong>Please note: All of our products are shipped in branded boxes.<\/strong><\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_tab_VePtX7":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Perfect Serve","icon":"bottle","content":"<h3>Espresso Martini<\/h3><p>Add your O’Donnell Vodka and Coffee Moonshine liqueur to a cocktail shaker with ice then poor in a shot of espresso. Shake well, then strain into a martini glass.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_tab_F7BRbP":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Allergen Information","icon":"nut_free","content":"<p>All of our Moonshines, unless indicated otherwise, are allergen free in accordance with Regulation (EU) No 1169\/2011 and amendments. All of our products, unless stated otherwise, are suitable for vegans and those with a gluten intolerance.<\/p><p>All of our spirits are produced using wheat based alcohol. While the distillation process removes gluten from the final product, individuals with certain conditions (i.e coeliac disease) may wish to exercise caution prior to purchase.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_tab_iPwypF":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Our Loyalty Scheme - The Gang","icon":"silhouette","content":"<p>Join our loyalty scheme 'The Gang' <a href=\"\/pages\/gang\" title=\"O'Donnell Gang\">here<\/a> to earn points, receive some amazing rewards and gain early access to exciting new products!<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-1":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Shipping","icon":"truck","content":"<p><strong>£3.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&lt; <\/strong>2kg<br\/><strong>£5.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&gt; <\/strong>2kg<\/p><p><strong>Free shipping<\/strong> for orders over £70!<\/p><p>Shipping cost to Northern Ireland is set at £16.95<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["title","caption","8e29b3b3-eb8c-4755-aaec-d317609f4f19","price","description","variant_picker","link_Qw9g6W","quantity_selector","buy_buttons","6d5b98cf-5085-441e-8662-08829574072f","wishlist_engine_product_page_9YHNFk","recommended_products_Tr3Xkp","collapsible_tab_qXXk9B","collapsible_tab_VePtX7","collapsible_tab_F7BRbP","collapsible_tab_iPwypF","collapsible-row-1"],"settings":{"gift_card_receipient_enabled":true,"is_above_the_fold":true,"enable_sticky_info":true,"badges_enabled":false,"gallery_layout":"thumbnail","media_size":"small","mobile_thumbnails":"hide","hide_variants":true,"enable_video_looping":false,"padding_top":24,"padding_bottom":12}},"image_with_text_fJTJCw":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_amJ78K":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Our Sell Out Coffee Moonshine is Back!","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_DhKVa7":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Coffee was a hit<em> <\/em>as the Advent Calendar exclusive flavour for 2022, but it wasn't around for long. Now, the wait is finally over 